flowchart TD
  A([Stack operation]) --> B{Operation}
  B -->|push| C{Current size equals capacity?}
  C -->|Yes| D[Throw overflow_error]
  C -->|No| E[Append value]
  B -->|pop or peek| F{Stack empty?}
  F -->|Yes| G[Throw underflow_error]
  F -->|No| H[Return top value]
  B -->|rotateLeft| I[Move first occupied value to end]
  B -->|rotateRight| J[Move last occupied value to beginning]
  E --> K([Complete])
  D --> K
  G --> K
  H --> K
  I --> K
  J --> K
